WEBVTT

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:27.070
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.850
Go! Shock!!

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:38.180
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:41.020
Friends who share the same future

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:43.720
With you guys

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:46.720
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:49.390
If we join forces

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:52.360
We’ll be invincible

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.700
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:02.870
Delicious food gives life

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:09.010
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:11.080
Let’s eat!!

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:14.020
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:17.160
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:22.330
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:22.330 --> 00:01:25.330
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.030
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:33.070
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:35.940
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:39.940
For the sake of tomorrow

00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:42.150
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:51.690
Someone once said...

00:01:52.160 --> 00:01:54.190
If prepared just right,

00:01:54.190 --> 00:02:00.370
this anglerfish will respond to delighted 
cries of "Encore!" and come back.

00:01:57.200 --> 00:02:04.000
Anglercore created by 
Nana Mizuki-san of Tokyo!

00:02:00.370 --> 00:02:04.800
Anglercore!

00:02:05.170 --> 00:02:10.110
However, if a "double 
encore's" worth is eaten,

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:15.680
a white-garbed angel will appear 
to gently soothe your malady,

00:02:15.010 --> 00:02:23.660
Eggplanurse created by created 
by Ryotaro Okiayu-san of Tokyo!

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:18.680
an eggplant that behaves like a nurse...

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:23.620
Eggplanurse!

00:02:23.890 --> 00:02:25.190
I'm cured!

00:02:26.460 --> 00:02:30.030
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:30.030 --> 00:02:35.200
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:40.810
The Four-Beasts have come from 
the Gourmet World to eat humans,

00:02:40.810 --> 00:02:44.180
but Toriko and the rest of the 
Four Kings have intercepted them!

00:02:53.350 --> 00:02:58.920
Meanwhile, Rin and Komatsu have learned 
a shocking truth from Ichiryu's message.

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:02.530
Actually, the Four-Beasts aren't four Beasts.

00:03:02.890 --> 00:03:04.030
They're one!

00:03:06.230 --> 00:03:10.230
There's someone in the shadows 
controlling the actual Four-Beasts.

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:14.040
The mastermind who truly 
needs to be taken down

00:03:14.370 --> 00:03:15.770
is him!

00:03:16.610 --> 00:03:21.910
Not knowing the truth, the Four 
Kings face the Four-Beasts!

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:25.950
Okay. Here's where we really get to it.

00:03:25.950 --> 00:03:28.390
How about I show you my new skills,

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:32.860
gained through Honoring 
the Food and Gut Instinct?

00:03:34.630 --> 00:03:39.900
Toriko's New Crisis! The Creeping 
Main Body of the Four-Beasts!

00:03:48.470 --> 00:03:50.040
Toriko!

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:51.880
Go!

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:00.620
They're not known as the 
Four Kings for nothing.

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:05.020
What's this?

00:04:06.690 --> 00:04:08.060
Something's here!

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:20.570
T-The Four Beasts aren't four Beasts?!

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:24.710
That's too important for the president 
to casually almost forget about!

00:04:24.710 --> 00:04:26.710
We have to let everyone know, and fast!

00:04:46.630 --> 00:04:48.330
Get back, Terry.

00:04:49.900 --> 00:04:53.570
From here on out, it's a serious 
showdown between me and this thing.

00:04:55.570 --> 00:04:57.640
It's do or die.

00:04:58.240 --> 00:05:02.580
What do you say we go with a natural, 
savage battle, with no hard feelings,

00:05:02.980 --> 00:05:04.450
Fang King?

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:10.290
I'm gonna show you... my serious Leg Knife!

00:05:10.820 --> 00:05:12.690
Even to you,

00:05:12.690 --> 00:05:15.190
it'll deliver a mortal wound if it hits!

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:23.670
Leg Knife!

00:05:36.380 --> 00:05:37.780
Not surprised.

00:05:37.780 --> 00:05:40.050
You were able to dodge it, huh?

00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:43.720
But before I learned Honoring the Food,

00:05:43.720 --> 00:05:45.890
I wasn't able to form quite this many.

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:53.330
Flying Fork.

00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:58.400
One at a time, with their size and force,

00:05:58.400 --> 00:06:01.670
they'd be hard-pressed 
to serve you any damage,

00:06:01.870 --> 00:06:04.440
but what about en masse?

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:12.480
I'll call it...

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:15.350
Cannon Fork!

00:06:17.860 --> 00:06:20.590
At that speed,

00:06:20.590 --> 00:06:21.960
you'll be able to avoid it.

00:06:22.490 --> 00:06:24.360
I'm sure that's what you're figuring.

00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:33.370
That's the Leg Knife you 
thought you'd dodged.

00:06:34.170 --> 00:06:36.340
Thanks to Honoring the Food and Gut Instinct,

00:06:36.340 --> 00:06:39.640
it's become possible for me to have 
finer control than ever before.

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:42.980
A tracking-type Knife...

00:06:42.980 --> 00:06:44.980
I'll call it Leg Boomerang!

00:06:47.650 --> 00:06:49.450
And like I said,

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:51.520
you'll suffer a mortal wound if it hits.

00:06:52.120 --> 00:06:53.320
With the damage you've sustained,

00:06:54.130 --> 00:06:56.760
you won't be able to avoid this Cannon Fork!

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:02.130
The living eats the living.

00:07:02.130 --> 00:07:04.400
That's the law of nature.

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:06.540
And that's why

00:07:06.540 --> 00:07:08.870
I have no grudge against you

00:07:08.870 --> 00:07:11.140
for intending to eat humans.

00:07:11.140 --> 00:07:13.650
I don't think it's an act of evil.

00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:15.410
The only thing is...

00:07:16.810 --> 00:07:20.450
There are some humans that 
just don't make for easy prey.

00:07:27.730 --> 00:07:29.760
Thank you for the meal.

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:35.430
He beat a Four-Beast!

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:37.000
He did it!

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:38.300
Toriko!

00:07:38.940 --> 00:07:40.970
Hey, look at the screen over there!

00:07:43.510 --> 00:07:45.040
Invite Death...

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:47.050
How's Coco doing?!

00:07:51.520 --> 00:07:53.080
Inside my body,

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:57.490
I created antibodies that negate 
the effects of your poison.

00:07:58.420 --> 00:08:02.490
So your poison won't work on me.

00:08:07.870 --> 00:08:09.630
So now you'll try a physical attack,

00:08:09.630 --> 00:08:12.070
go for hand-to-hand combat, eh?

00:08:12.600 --> 00:08:14.070
However,

00:08:15.440 --> 00:08:16.970
take this first!

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:18.080
My Poison Arrow!

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:30.790
That arrow I just shot you with?

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:35.160
The tip is made out of a new kind of poison.

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:37.600
I call it Poison Virus!

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:42.770
Poison Virus changes its form,

00:08:42.770 --> 00:08:45.270
turning into a poison that the 
targeted creature is vulnerable to.

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:49.770
It's a virus that's particularly 
effective against creatures that have

00:08:49.770 --> 00:08:51.110
many antibodies against poison.

00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:57.380
Right now, the virus is searching to 
see what kind of poison works on you.

00:08:59.820 --> 00:09:03.720
Naturally, you'll try to 
kill me before that happens.

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:07.090
Unfortunately for you,

00:09:07.090 --> 00:09:10.430
this poison spear will pierce 
that thought in an instant.

00:09:12.600 --> 00:09:16.770
According to one theory, 
when mold spores fly,

00:09:16.770 --> 00:09:18.870
they're the fastest things 
in the living world.

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:21.340
Now, this poison spear

00:09:21.340 --> 00:09:24.110
is made out of poison that's 
similar to mold spores.

00:09:24.110 --> 00:09:27.880
I'm sure you won't even 
realize that it's hit you.

00:09:29.350 --> 00:09:31.180
Mold Spear!

00:09:37.920 --> 00:09:42.560
Dodging a poison spear that travels 
at the speed of light is impossible.

00:09:43.630 --> 00:09:46.600
Although it did take me all this 
time to produce just one...

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:50.270
Still, in the battle of poisons,

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:53.340
it looks like I'm the winner.

00:09:59.340 --> 00:10:01.550
Even a disgusting body like yours

00:10:02.210 --> 00:10:04.180
loses some of the sting when it can't move.

00:10:04.420 --> 00:10:08.820
There's no point in struggling. Those 
tentacles of yours can't even twitch.

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:16.160
It's not my Hair Lock that's 
keeping you in check.

00:10:16.730 --> 00:10:18.430
Putting Hair Lock on a 
strong bastard like you

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:21.470
might result in my hair being torn out.

00:10:22.530 --> 00:10:26.370
My hair, which has become much more 
sensitive from Honoring the Food,

00:10:26.370 --> 00:10:29.270
has already invaded your nervous system

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:31.680
and taken over the movements 
of your tentacles.

00:10:32.810 --> 00:10:34.550
Hair Marionette!

00:10:34.550 --> 00:10:38.080
Even now, you're my puppet.

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:43.620
Although having my hair inside your 
body is completely repulsive...

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:51.330
On top of that, I'm deflecting a Hair Punch

00:10:51.700 --> 00:10:55.470
with Super Spatula, making it 
go back and forth over and over.

00:10:55.470 --> 00:10:59.970
It takes some time, but the force 
of the punch keeps increasing.

00:11:03.310 --> 00:11:05.180
Even with just the scant hair 
that I have left to use,

00:11:05.910 --> 00:11:09.350
repeatedly employing Super Spatula

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:13.080
lets me build up plenty of power.

00:11:16.890 --> 00:11:19.120
Super Hair Shot!

00:11:23.860 --> 00:11:27.170
You're ugly even when 
you're being blown away.

00:11:37.010 --> 00:11:41.010
Voice Meteor Shower alone ain't 
enough to bring you down, huh?

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:43.210
I was hopin' it wouldn't be!

00:11:48.750 --> 00:11:51.320
But take the destructive force of my punch

00:11:51.320 --> 00:11:53.760
an' add sound vibrations...

00:11:56.190 --> 00:11:57.800
Let's see what happens.

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:03.070
I'm thinkin' it'll destroy 
your body from the inside out!

00:12:05.400 --> 00:12:08.240
Beat Punch!

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:22.320
Have you learned anything?

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:24.760
Like you don't wanna be cocky...

00:12:25.160 --> 00:12:26.290
...around me!

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:37.470
You'll have plenty of time 
to review in the afterlife.

00:12:54.390 --> 00:12:56.490
That's your punishment for bein' cocky.

00:13:02.030 --> 00:13:03.360
Somethin' weird about this.

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:07.870
I seen countless creatures die,

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:10.900
but that scream ain't 
no kind of death rattle.

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:16.870
This guy's life ain't over yet.

00:13:18.740 --> 00:13:19.980
What?

00:13:20.880 --> 00:13:22.950
Toriko! Coco! Zebra!

00:13:22.950 --> 00:13:24.280
Bro, can you hear me?!

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:25.650
Rin!

00:13:25.650 --> 00:13:28.650
Huh. So this is a communication device too.

00:13:28.650 --> 00:13:31.520
We're in real trouble here! I 
found out something important!

00:13:31.760 --> 00:13:34.590
The Four-Beasts isn't actually 
four Beasts, but one!

00:13:34.590 --> 00:13:35.530
What?!

00:13:35.930 --> 00:13:37.160
It's not four Beasts?!

00:13:38.430 --> 00:13:40.100
Rin, what do you mean?!

00:13:40.470 --> 00:13:43.900
We watched the rest of 
President Ichiryu's message

00:13:43.900 --> 00:13:45.000
and that's what he said.

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:55.480
Terry!

00:13:57.680 --> 00:13:59.620
The Four-Beasts is one Beast...

00:14:01.090 --> 00:14:02.120
Certainly...

00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:06.660
...I can't see

00:14:06.660 --> 00:14:08.030
the shadow of death on it yet.

00:14:11.630 --> 00:14:12.600
It went underground?!

00:14:16.770 --> 00:14:19.040
Heading in that direction... Don't tell me...

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:20.300
Kiss!

00:14:31.920 --> 00:14:32.720
What?!

00:14:34.290 --> 00:14:37.390
No wonder it didn't let out a death rattle.

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:40.390
What's it doin'?!

00:14:44.660 --> 00:14:47.470
Echo Location!

00:14:54.340 --> 00:14:56.210
Where do you think you're goin'?!

00:14:56.210 --> 00:14:59.040
Cocky bastard!

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:02.510
Let's go, Daruma Horse!

00:15:04.620 --> 00:15:06.450
Komatsu! Rin!

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:08.650
Grab hold!

00:15:08.650 --> 00:15:10.150
R-Right!

00:15:12.290 --> 00:15:15.060
Hey, now what's this about being one Beast?!

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:17.560
What's the deal with this Four-Beasts?!

00:15:17.860 --> 00:15:20.200
The president explained it 
with images in his message.

00:15:21.430 --> 00:15:24.700
Actually, the Four-Beasts aren't 
four Beasts. They're one!

00:15:26.370 --> 00:15:29.140
The Four-Beasts' main body 
is like a control tower.

00:15:29.140 --> 00:15:34.710
It grows bulbous seeds of life 
on its limbs underground.

00:15:35.650 --> 00:15:38.550
Those seeds take several hundred years

00:15:38.550 --> 00:15:41.150
to become mature Beasts,

00:15:41.150 --> 00:15:42.920
the four Beasts of the Four-Beasts.

00:15:44.260 --> 00:15:47.990
The main body releases those four 
Beasts into the Human World,

00:15:47.990 --> 00:15:50.600
letting them eat to their heart's content.

00:15:50.600 --> 00:15:54.900
And when the Beasts return, it takes them in

00:15:55.230 --> 00:15:57.670
and absorbs the humans.

00:15:57.670 --> 00:16:00.870
This is the Four-Beasts' established pattern.

00:16:00.870 --> 00:16:02.110
However,

00:16:02.110 --> 00:16:05.310
the last time they were sent 
here, I drove them away.

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:09.780
So they didn't eat any humans then.

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:14.350
In fact, they were mortally wounded 
when they returned to the main body.

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:19.790
So even the one-pattern Four-Beasts 
may change its strategy this time.

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:24.300
It's possible that the main body 
itself will head for the Human World.

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:28.130
The main body in the Human World?!

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:29.700
I see. Terry!

00:16:30.700 --> 00:16:34.040
The direction you were looking in before 
is the center of the Human World!

00:16:39.310 --> 00:16:40.350
That's the way!

00:16:44.450 --> 00:16:45.880
The Four-Beasts ran away!

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:47.850
The Four-Beasts were driven back!

00:16:47.850 --> 00:16:49.890
The Four Kings won!

00:16:49.890 --> 00:16:52.820
The human race won!

00:16:56.430 --> 00:16:58.000
Terry looks...

00:16:58.430 --> 00:16:59.400
...strange.

00:17:08.010 --> 00:17:08.970
What is that?

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:12.840
It's... Oh, no!

00:17:33.830 --> 00:17:34.570
What is it?!

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:35.230
What's wrong?!

00:17:41.570 --> 00:17:42.840
What the hell...?!

00:18:13.570 --> 00:18:17.080
Do you think the others 
are able to pursue it too?

00:18:17.080 --> 00:18:18.740
No problem there!

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:21.750
Just like Terry and I are tracking 
Fang King with our olfactory senses...

00:18:30.860 --> 00:18:33.120
...Coco's using electromagnetic waves...

00:18:37.230 --> 00:18:39.200
...Sunny is using the sense of touch...

00:18:49.110 --> 00:18:51.540
...and I'm sure Zebra is following 
it with ultrasonic waves.

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:55.010
At least we're not gonna lose track of it!

00:18:55.550 --> 00:19:00.050
But I don't believe the old man, 
forgetting to tell us this upfront!

00:19:00.050 --> 00:19:05.420
Well, some of it's due to Zebra-san 
cutting the message off...

00:19:05.860 --> 00:19:07.160
Hey, Rin!

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:09.460
Was there anything else 
he forgot to mention?!

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:13.730
A-Actually, there is one more thing...

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:26.980
Gotta admit we weren't expecting this.

00:19:28.580 --> 00:19:31.020
Is it time for me to step up?

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:51.230
I have been alone

00:20:53.130 --> 00:20:58.770
Ever since that day

00:21:00.370 --> 00:21:06.610
All I got was a definite history

00:21:06.710 --> 00:21:13.220
But tomorrow is still, still, 
still just an uncertain dream

00:21:13.220 --> 00:21:16.820
It’s like a tautology, logy

00:21:16.820 --> 00:21:20.390
This is a tautology, logy

00:21:20.390 --> 00:21:24.130
A dream is still a dream

00:21:24.130 --> 00:21:27.700
Not gonna wake up, logy, logy

00:21:27.700 --> 00:21:32.200
Right now, we’re lookin’ at

00:21:32.200 --> 00:21:35.870
What it is we're lookin' at

00:21:35.870 --> 00:21:43.450
The thing we’re lookin’ 
at ain’t no illusion

00:21:45.980 --> 00:21:48.950
Find Yun! Run, Run, Yun!

00:21:49.450 --> 00:21:53.490
Yun is hiding somewhere in the image 
you're about to see, so please find him!

00:21:53.490 --> 00:22:04.500
Hiding Level 127

00:21:54.090 --> 00:21:57.430
Today, Yun's Hiding Level is... 127?!

00:21:57.430 --> 00:21:59.560
That's like Fang King's level!

00:21:59.560 --> 00:22:02.600
Since this is a really tough one, the 
allotted time limit is 20 seconds.

00:22:02.600 --> 00:22:04.500
Let's have a heaping helping of start!

00:22:05.200 --> 00:22:08.070
R-Reviver Teppei's illustrated diary?!

00:22:08.070 --> 00:22:12.040
His letters are unique... and so is 
the picture! What is that drawing?

00:22:12.040 --> 00:22:13.950
Just like it says!

00:22:13.950 --> 00:22:17.180
"When I went to the beach, Yun, Toriko 
and the others were swimming."

00:22:17.180 --> 00:22:19.550
The answer's right there, clear as day!

00:22:19.550 --> 00:22:22.320
Actually, I can't make even one 
gram of heads or tails of it.

00:22:22.320 --> 00:22:25.720
W-What's what? Who's who?!

00:22:25.720 --> 00:22:27.990
Yun is... right here!

00:22:26.160 --> 00:22:29.760
beach ball
Rin
Ryu
watermelon
Komatsu

00:22:27.990 --> 00:22:29.760
He's obviously right here!

00:22:37.600 --> 00:22:40.510
We'll have a better one for you next time,

00:22:40.510 --> 00:22:42.370
so don't abandon this segment!

00:22:42.740 --> 00:22:46.010
At last, the Four-Beasts' true form appears!

00:22:46.010 --> 00:22:49.610
What's the fate of the Four 
Kings... and the human race?!

00:22:51.940 --> 00:22:53.840
Toriko and the rest of the Four Kings are all...!

00:22:53.840 --> 00:22:56.220
They're powerless against the massive beast they're up against!

00:22:56.220 --> 00:22:58.670
And then, the poison rain begins to fall...!

00:22:59.280 --> 00:23:02.030
The Four-Beasts' Shocking Combined Form and Green Rain!

00:23:02.030 --> 00:23:04.030
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
